adaptation = "The formula is evaluated in the source-supported fq=None mode so OHLC and VWAP remain in the same unadjusted price units. The signal uses information through the T-day close and is evaluated against the standard T+1 open return. Normalization audit: Normalized the source equality symbol '=' to parser equality '=='."
